 "description": "Get everything recorded about one screen: notes on what it does and how it's laid out, source\nURL, image URLs and dimensions, observed actions and where they lead, and page sections for\nlong marketing pages.\n\nUse this to understand a specific UI pattern in detail before building something similar.",
